  "reviewStatus": "pending",
  "officialRef": {
    "pdf": "初2第3辑初初中时文阅读提分训练3+X第3辑8年级答案.pdf",
    "pages": [
      7
    ]
  },
  "answers": {
    "q1": {
      "slots": {
        "b1": {
          "accept": [
            "leaving"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "catch sb doing sth 是固定搭配，“撞见某人正在做某事”，所以 leave 用 -ing 形式 leaving。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p1",
          "quote": "When he catches dog owners"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q2": {
      "slots": {
        "b2": {
          "accept": [
            "himself"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "市长自己动手把狗粪捡起来，主语是 he，反身代词用 himself，表示“亲自”。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p1",
          "quote": "Other times, he picks them up"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q3": {
      "slots": {
        "b3": {
          "accept": [
            "is found"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "if 引导条件句，主句是将来时，从句用一般现在时；狗粪是“被发现”，所以用被动 is found。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p2",
          "quote": "And if dog poop"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q4": {
      "slots": {
        "b4": {
          "accept": [
            "for"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "pay for 是固定搭配，意思是“为……付钱”，所以填 for。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p2",
          "quote": "And the owner will have to pay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q5": {
      "slots": {
        "b5a": {
          "accept": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        "b5b": {
          "accept": [
            "a"
          ]
        },
        "b5c": {
          "accept": [
            "result"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "前半句“减轻环卫工人负担”和后半句“减少政府开支”是因果关系，三个空填 as a result（因此）。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p3",
          "quote": "The mayor hopes the new rule will help reduce"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q6": {
      "slots": {
        "b6": {
          "accept": [
            "to hire"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "plan to do sth 是固定搭配，“计划做某事”，所以用 to hire。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p4",
          "quote": "The town plans"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q7": {
      "slots": {
        "b7": {
          "accept": [
            "other"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "狗粪里的细菌会传给人和“其他”动物，所以填 other。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p5",
          "quote": "can spread to"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q8": {
      "slots": {
        "b8": {
          "accept": [
            "organise",
            "organize"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "will 后面接动词原形；括号里 organisation 是名词，对应的动词是 organise。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p6",
          "quote": "The city will"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q9": {
      "slots": {
        "b9": {
          "accept": [
            "If",
            "if"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "这里是在假设“如果游客不捡狗粪”，是条件句，用 If 引导（句首大写）。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p7",
          "quote": "The rule mostly applies to locals."
        }
      ]
    },
    "q10": {
      "slots": {
        "b10": {
          "accept": [
            "who"
          ]
        }
      },
      "explanationZh": "这是强调句 It’s us ... who ...，被强调的是人（us, the people of Béziers），所以填 who。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block": "p7",
          "quote": "“It’s us, the people of Béziers,"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}